(
    title: "E.T. - The Extra-Terrestrial",
    developer: Some("Howard Scott Warshaw"),
    description: Some("Six screens of Planet Earth hide the three pieces of E.T.\'s interplanetary phone at the bottom of deep wells: fall in, stretch your neck to levitate out, and watch the energy that every step and float costs. His powers only fire inside matching power zones — the symbol at the top of the screen names the one you\'re standing in — while a scientist hauls him away for study and an FBI agent prowls the sites. Assemble the phone, call the ship, and make the forest landing pad before the timer runs out; Reese\'s Pieces restore energy or summon Elliott."),
